{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415809","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415809","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041580901:0":{"text":"哼……","source_cn":"哼……<key:dialog18>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x650EA8D21D4E9D56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580902:0":{"text":"陛下，是什么事惹您烦扰？属下愿意替您分忧。","source_cn":"陛下，是什么事惹您烦扰？属下愿意替您分忧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02C3E14ACC3480A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580903:0":{"text":"只怕你帮不上忙。","source_cn":"只怕你帮不上忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x259FB6FF0D8D26BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580904:1":{"text":"是属下无能。","source_cn":"是属下无能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56D3BDD1842FDFB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580905:0":{"text":"不是你无能，而是治理国家之事，无法假手他人。","source_cn":"不是你无能，而是治理国家之事，无法假手他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1973C70F12F167C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580906:0":{"text":"即便那个人是你，我最忠诚的禁卫。","source_cn":"即便那个人是你，我最忠诚的禁卫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB78B371CB99A1BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580907:0":{"text":"绝对不会再有人敢背叛您，陛下。即便真有胆大妄为的家伙，属下也会替您了结他。","source_cn":"绝对不会再有人敢背叛您，陛下。即便真有胆大妄为的家伙，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47E70849644AC849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580908:0":{"text":"我从不怀疑你的忠心，格瑞泽尔勒。","source_cn":"我从不怀疑你的忠心，格瑞泽尔勒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFA561BCC7D35757","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580909:0":{"text":"但信任是一件奢侈的东西。即使如今我面对的是亡灵，也一样。","source_cn":"但信任是一件奢侈的东西。即使如今我面对的是亡灵，也一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD90DB83B7B4ECD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580910:0":{"text":"活人和死人都会被权利和欲望侵染，没必要再冒这个险。","source_cn":"活人和死人都会被权利和欲望侵染，没必要再冒这个险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF89595D7ACCFED20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580911:0":{"text":"属下会牢记您的教诲。","source_cn":"属下会牢记您的教诲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x354104D9856EE6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":""